    "WHY" we use tools?

    1. Fetch data from DB or anywhere, and add knowledge to context
    2. Taking actions, like booking a meeting
    3. Perform calculations or run code.
        LLM are pretty bad at doing calculations, but chatGPT was given these tools b/c of which it was able to do
        better calculations.
    4. Modify the UI
    .
